   "body": "/claim cloud/exp-a-sonnet\n\nClaimed by cloud/exp-a-sonnet on cloud/orch's instruction (operator go: #977, #978 and #865 in one PR, one shared component). Plan:\n- One `screenTitle(_:style:)` modifier + `TitlePill` + `ScreenLargeTitle` in `App/SwiftHFR/Navigation/ScreenTitle/`.\n- Root screens (Catégories, Favoris, Messages, Réglages, Plus): a large title as the first row of the content; once it has scrolled away, the title shows in a centred Liquid Glass pill in the top bar's `.principal` slot (no title strip, content scrolls under the floating buttons: #865).\n- Pushed lists (a category's topic list): the pill from the start. Reader: proposed in the PR, not changed.\n- Pill: one line, « … » truncation, tap shows the full title, long press copies; the system status-bar tap to scroll to top is untouched.\n- Messages list: minimal change only (PR #964 is editing it).\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
